			},
			"date": "2026-10-03T13:42:00.547Z",
			"content": "<p>I once visited a website that had no user facing element and still asked. Out of curiosity I used a burner account to sign in. I reached the Admin Panel and was able to change texts on the website. 😬</p>\n<p>(I informed the author of the website and he removed the option)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
